        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tommy Swerdlow, Jon Turteltaub, Leon, Doug E. Doug, Rawle D. Lewis, Malik Yoba, John Candy, George B. Fitch\n- Films: Howard the Duck, Spaceballs, Cool Runnings, Little Giants, Snow Dogs, A Thousand Junkies\n\nFacts:\n- Tommy Swerdlow appeared in the film \"Howard the Duck\" in 1986.\n- Tommy Swerdlow appeared in the film \"Spaceballs\" in 1987.\n- \"Cool Runnings\" is a 1993 American comedy sports film directed by Jon Turteltaub.\n- \"Cool Runnings\" stars Leon, Doug E. Doug, Rawle D. Lewis, Malik Yoba, and John Candy.\n- Tommy Swerdlow co-wrote the screenplay for \"Cool Runnings\" in 1993.\n- George B. Fitch's success inspired the Disney film \"Cool Runnings.\"\n- Tommy Swerdlow co-wrote the screenplay for \"Little Giants\" in 1994.\n- Tommy Swerdlow co-wrote the screenplay for \"Snow Dogs\" in 2002.\n- \"A Thousand Junkies\" is a 2017 American comedy-drama film directed by and starring Tommy Swerdlow.",
